# oracle: native binary restart of fix temp/csvr (energy and RanMars state of write_restart, fix_temp_csvr.cpp restart and random_mars.cpp set_state): read by the engine, temp/csvr re-specified and run 20 steps
# oracle-inputs: w187rs_csvr_native.restart
# native: b332f28 built as the parity binary wrote w187rs_csvr_native.restart (fcc lj, 20 steps of fix temp/csvr 1.0 1.0 0.5 7531, 108 atoms)
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all rel=1e-12 abs=1e-14
# measured: the case passes at rel=1e-14 abs=0 (tightest tested), so the tolerance is 1e-12
read_restart    w187rs_csvr_native.restart
fix             1 all nve
fix             t all temp/csvr 1.0 1.0 0.5 7531
thermo_style    custom step temp pe etotal ecouple econserve
thermo_modify   format float %.15g
thermo          4
run             20
